<i>TURN-A</i>

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.110
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:06.690
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:07.110
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:27.480
<i>Lady Lily Borjarno's assistance has become Sir Guin's most important chance-</i>

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.270
<i>-to springboard himself back to the top again.</i>

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:32.530
<i>During all this, I was sent to assist Keith.</i>

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:37.150
<i>While there, Luzianna's mobile suit squadron decides to pick a fight with me...</i>

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:40.280
<i>...and I found myself encountering Ms. Teteth Halleh once again.</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.210
<b>Kihel And Dianna</b>

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.570
So...

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:03.670
We know that Dianna was threatened by someone within the Moonrace.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:07.560
It seems that Dianna Counter's not as united as one would suspect, Laura.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.440
Yes, that mechanical doll was not from the Militia.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.060
Those from the moon are acting rather oddly.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:18.650
Tomorrow, you have been invited to join the Queen's ceremony.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.940
I received one as well?

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.490
This... this isn't for me, is it?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.240
You're the only one we can call Laura Rola.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.840
This party's gonna be rough...

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:37.840
I'll have to borrow a dress from Miss Lily... Don't you feel overwhelmed, sis?

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:42.340
I don't have much choice either. I'll be thankful to have anything ready for it.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:45.770
If I had known to expect an event like this, I would've brought a dress from home with me.

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:49.480
Sochie, you need to watch those manners of yours.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.550
Whatever.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:06.540
If this goes on, Miss Kihel will be in danger.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.360
Not only that, but if this declaration of a fiefdom goes through...

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.140
Loran, could I speak to you for a moment?

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.860
Could I have a moment?

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.420
Please.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:43.770
I'd like to have you inspect the speech for tomorrow's declaration, Queen Dianna.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.870
About this matter...

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.660
Do you think all of the Moonrace agrees with this declaration?

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.370
No, that is a separate matter.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.750
Understood. l will look this over.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.960
First thing tomorrow morning, then.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.540
Yes.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.760
Queen Dianna, the situation here isn't very encouraging.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:11.260
I have no idea what to do with this declaration.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.140
How could...

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.660
This song was playing when you proposed to me.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.450
Stop it, otherwise you'll be disturbing the others.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.450
Just for a little bit.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.310
Isn't it strange... I never...

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:57.470
But... how could it be, that Queen Dianna's here next to me!?

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:07.940
I respected and admired both Queen Dianna and Lady Kihel...

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:12.150
...and yet I couldn't even tell one from the other!

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.830
Loran Cehack,

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.540
You realize... the important issue is that Kihel Heim's now in a tough position.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.160
Miss Kihel's life may even be in danger.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.640
This happened because we played some idiotic game.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:32.770
Milady Kihel? She's aboard the Soleil?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.520
Yes, that's right... the Lady could only be aboard the Soleil...

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.940
That's correct.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.270
She ended up being forced to replace me.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:44.650
To become the target of Mobile Suits, and to make that Declaration.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:48.660
We can't allow that girl to go through this any longer.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.370
Yes, no longer...

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:55.960
This is for the good of the moon, and also for the good of the earth.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:59.330
Loran Cehack, please lend me your power.

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:05.050
But me... this power... you really think I have it?

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.440
You've taken all the food in the entire village!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.730
If the Sunbelt becomes independent, you can use goods from the military. Isn't that enough?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.270
Hey, let's go.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.270
Hey, Chief, we're here for the wine.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:34.450
Chief, sleeping in a drafty place like this'll get you sick.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.660
l was waiting for you guys to get here.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.170
I'm sorry. Where's the owner?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.670
I'm here to represent him.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:46.840
There have been too many separate orders for him to be here personally.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.260
ls that alright?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.550
Thanks for the help, we've been quite busy today.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.050
Just bring this to the gate at the reception.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.430
Two truck loads of wine.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.850
That's right, sir.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.560
Morning, everyone!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:03.270
I've brought the first wine truck over here.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.150
Couldn't you wait and bring over both trucks, Miss?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:10.150
Well, I'd heard the bartender here won't shut up, so rushed to make sure I wasn't late.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.820
Sorry, Miss, I've already talked it over with the soldier here.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.870
Let's go, Miss.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.450
Right. It was a pleasure!

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:31.970
Would it have been better if I had worn my hair out a bit longer?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.470
You think so? Since you're only a student, I thought you looked just fine.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.170
Except for the fact that I'm a pilot.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:41.270
The security for such an important declaration shouldn't be as this weak.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.760
Agreed.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:45.940
Having an Emergency landing and then holding such a ceremony...

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.940
I can only wonder what's happening within the ranks of Dianna Counter now.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:03.070
It's Milady Kihel who's currently on the Soleil.
Was she the one who sent out these invitations?

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:10.160
Kihel even figured out how to forge her signature.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:19.850
Because of the "Dust Blow" that happened earlier, the meeting area wasn't properly prepared.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.640
So what? As long as it's on time, it doesn't matter.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.600
Right.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:27.150
However, Harry, is the army well prepared for this event?

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.730
Just because we are declaring a fiefdom for ourselves within the Sunbelt...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:33.360
...it doesn't mean that we intend to completely overthrow the region.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.570
That's right.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:38.450
Floria's the only region we'll still need to convince.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.160
Tell that to Commander Phil and his people, please.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.960
We will try not to expand our front.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.540
If we do that, the Ameria Landowners...

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.670
...will not object as much to the division of their territory.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.670
Do you honestly not wish to expand the scope of the war?

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.340
That's correct.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.250
This declaration is only for a tactical advantage, correct?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:03.480
My own parents were put into cryostasis and dreamed of seeing us living on earth together.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:09.850
But because they were simple common folk they were only allowed basic hibernation. My father never survived.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:30.750
Miss Laura Rola...

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.840
Yes?

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.840
Why don't you take your Mobile Suit and join with us?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.760
The earth's forces will use our powers to defeat you.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.050
This is amazing.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:50.110
Milady Kihel, Loran and Queen Dianna have come to help you.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:55.940
The mustached Mobile Suit is here, and so is Laura Rola...

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.210
The earth people are treating our declaration ceremony like it's some old university reunion.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.660
You want to let a man inspect this young girl's body?!

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.040
It's just that we're short of people...

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.460
She's here with Guin Rhineford!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.830
Come right in.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.340
We look too casual, right?

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.960
Let's see, we'll try it at max magnification...

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.760
Oh, wow! Is that it?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.350
That's the truck that belongs to those Inglessa jerks.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.680
There he is. It's Lieutenant Yanni.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:33.140
Now those space alien bastards are in for a real surprise!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.950
Shouldn't you be with your father, Miss Lily Borjarno?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.270
Thank you.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.740
Oh, I'm very sorry.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.660
I had to borrow this dress from you.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.750
It's alright. Anything to help a Militia Pilot attend, right?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.830
Besides, it's an old dress.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.670
Miss Kihel, That isn't too tight in the waist for you, is it?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:57.050
Thank your very much. I've been able to attend thanks to your assistance.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.840
Did your father leave a message for me...?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.260
I'm only here to support you Sir Guin.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.850
And Lady Kihel?

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:09.390
Well, each of us seems to have our own feelings about the matter.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:11.560
Sister?

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.850
Miss Sochie...

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.360
Sir Guin?

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.650
There's nothing I can do here at the moment.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.790
Only my Secretary, Kihel is capable of that.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.660
Is that so?

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.150
Well, Sir Guin's the one paying her, isn't he?

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.950
Who are you?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:30.080
You're not allowed here!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.040
You...

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.790
At ease, men.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:39.960
l wanted to be sure your daily work was up to par.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.610
- The Royal guard asked me to escort her here.
- I need to head in and change.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:47.260
That's good, keep it up. Call Mitchell's Squadron!

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.020
Is that all you can handle?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:54.230
Don't be too greedy. We have to save some of this for the party.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.940
That's absolutely right.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.060
Come on, Captain.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.360
Is this stuff "sake"?

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.200
Even the babies on earth drink it, though.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.860
It's so strong...

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.530
Hey, this batch's good. The wine here's aged very nicely, Mr. Commander.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.710
I think the girls are even better!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.370
- Let's see how it's playing out...
- We've unloaded all of it.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.660
Well done.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:17.040
That mechanical doll holding the Red and White tent doesn't have a pilot.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.750
When will you let it run out of control?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.170
Who knows.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.840
Yanni, who should get the bill?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.470
The Captain here is the one who's drinking.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.300
Then give him this while he's still enjoying himself.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.350
Sure.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.770
What about the woman?

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.460
She's going with the plan.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.560
Were you the one who signed her up for this job, Colonel?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.940
She was the one I met in the truck when l went to buy this stuff wholesale.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.730
ls that right?

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.740
Yanni, The party is also being attended by Sir Guin.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.440
This 99% alcoholic drink will get these guys wasted before you can even blink.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.750
Okay then, who's next?

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:07.640
Thanks to that alcohol, their defenses should have a big fat hole in them soon.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.720
Miss Lily is in that blue and white tent.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.720
Whatever you do, DON'T hit it.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.810
We'll do hit and run attack on the Soleil, then retreat.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.110
This isn't good, let's find the elevator.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.610
So long as there is a man guarding it, it won't work.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.610
But...

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.490
We still have no idea what sort of situation Miss Kihel's in.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.760
Right.

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:31.530
So the wine's gonna cost...

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.420
This is too easy.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.830
Hey, sis...

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.130
The uniform's a bit tight in the chest.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.040
Where ya goin'?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:46.040
What are you planning to do?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:48.710
Hey, it's time to do this.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.020
Track it down with your WaDom, Lieutenant Poe!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.360
We can't let it crush one of the Terrans and get us in a political mess.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.030
This wine here isn't finished just yet!

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.110
Watch this!

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.620
Yanni, did you do it?

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.320
I made it in!

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:24.910
It's time! First we bombard then, then we fall back.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.430
A Militia attack!?

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.430
Sir Guin?

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.230
An attack?

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.730
I wasn't told about these plans!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.520
Nor was I.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.640
It's an attack!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.600
Please, hang on!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.910
I'll need to go up one level.

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:56.700
These two?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.830
What is it? Miss Dianna is conducting a secret investigation!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.000
Let's go this way...

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.130
So, Dianna...

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.090
- Ms. Teteth?
 -Teteth?

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.220
You're wrong! That person is Lady Kihel Heim!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.640
Is this Kihel Heim?

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.510
What are you-

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.140
I am...

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.920
Lady Kihel Heim!

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.800
Teteth!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.810
- Are you hurt?
- I'm fine.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.940
Laura Rola and Lady Kihel?

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.230
Right.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.150
Increase the protection around Queen Dianna!

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:31.400
Laura, Miss Kihel, why are you here?

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:34.120
She wished to speak to Dianna about the meaning of this Declaration.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.700
Lieutenant, l need to go up to her.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.320
I can't allow it!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.120
Stay where you are!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.110
Why not!?

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:52.120
I've got the renegade WaD.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:56.500
Everyone, please do not leave the tent. This is the safest place!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.600
If that mechanical doll was activated...

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.730
Stay put, little miss death-wish.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.310
Death-wish?

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.440
It's important to observe a fight from every angle...

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.020
...in order to decide how to best apply your own techniques and capabilities.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:11.740
Lily Borjarno is right, Lady Sochie.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.820
I should have been told about this plan beforehand!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.820
I no longer have any power over the Militia.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.700
He fell for the decoy Borjarnon!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:40.220
So we finally meet in person, Queen Dianna Soriel.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.930
Give me your name and rank.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:45.020
It's a pity. Since I've taken a job as an assassin in the darkness...

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.770
l cannot tell you who I am.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.610
Why do you wish to kill me?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.070
If you were to kill me, the fires of war on earth would only...

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.530
I am not a person from the earth.

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.620
You are mistaken if you believe that you are favored by all of the Moonrace.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.120
Were you contracted by Agrippa Maintainer?

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.040
It's for all of them! Not all of the people want to live on the earth, you know!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:07.080
I took this contract for the sake of the entire Moonrace's honor!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:10.040
If you think I'm doing this because I hate you ...I'm not!

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.620
Die!

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:25.940
She got away...

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.100
Are you uninjured?

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.930
Somehow.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.610
And what about the attack outside?

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.900
A SUMO intervened and put a stop to it.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.360
Naturally, none of our guests were injured.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.240
I'm so glad.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.950
We're about to pass the scheduled announcement time. Let's begin the declaration at once.

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:44.700
Right. Several of the leaders have arrived as well.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.910
We have to see her!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.630
I can't let you! This is Queen Dianna's private deck!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.170
- Escort them out.
- Sir!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.920
Harry, after that incident in the elevator, I'd like to use the stairs.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.920
I have to see Queen Dianna!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.430
Kihel Heim!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.510
Leave this place at once!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.930
This way.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.680
Queen Dianna tried to come here...

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:05.300
Go right ahead.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.310
I'm sorry for having to disappoint you after your journey from the countryside, Kihel Heim.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.820
Queen Dianna...

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.730
Are you going to announce the Declaration?

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:17.030
This is for the good of relations between both the Earth and the Moon.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.530
Really?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.820
Of course.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.620
In that case... good luck.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.200
Harry.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.540
Yes?

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.540
Send these two back to Sir Guin.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.120
But...

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.120
That's an order.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.790
Right.

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:33.500
What of the elevator?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.340
You can use it down here on this deck.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:39.050
Then please go back, Lady Laura and Lady Kihel.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.340
Of course, Sir Lieutenant.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:52.110
All of you... I ask this of all of you who share the gift of life...

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.930
Please, lower your weapons and listen to me!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:00.030
I do not wish for fighting.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:07.120
In the past, our own mother planet, the Earth, once became nearly uninhabitable thanks to the unforgivable actions of her past residents.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.620
This was chronicled in the pages of the Dark History.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.000
However...

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.210
Those of you who are from the Earth seem to have somehow forgotten all of this.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.960
- We've all forgotten that?
 - It looks that way.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:21.930
Forgetting the past deplorable choices is mankind's sad fate on this earth.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:27.640
We of the Moonrace have been living on the moon for a long time, waiting for the Earth to be reborn.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.020
Both for the sake of preserving humanity's memories...

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:33.020
...and for the sake of moving beyond them to revive humanity's prosperity.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:38.820
But now, a period of over 2,000 years has passed here on the earth...

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.410
...and it has been able to restore itself to life once more.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.830
Even if it hasn't done so completely, that rebirth is still a possibility.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:49.040
Therefore, we of the Moonrace seek to return to the Earth.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:53.920
Let us help you to revive this world and ensure that history's never allowed to repeat itself.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:59.340
Loran, Lady Kihel Heim has expressed the feelings of my own heart even better than I myself could have.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.800
Yes, I feel the same way.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.140
That's the true appearance of our lady.

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:14.020
The history of mankind's journey into space was preserved by those on earth as legends of heavenly beings, and then remnants of the Dark History were hidden...

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.610
...all to give you the power to recreate these things.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:22.030
Yet having mere memories of the past would not be enough to fully rebirth a civilization.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:26.030
So because of that, some humans have changed their explanation of history...

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:30.040
...and others sometimes even rewrite history completely.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:34.210
Yet our eyes, our noses and our lips are all the same.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:38.840
There is now no physical difference between the people of earth and the Moonrace.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.130
We are all part of the same humanity.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:47.300
l will now give up this idea of declaring a Moonrace fiefdom in the sunbelt...

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:54.300
...And I will instead request to once again begin negotiating with the people of Ameria.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.730
Is that... Dianna Soriel?

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:04.860
Kihel Heim, it seems that allowing you to lead the Moonrace was the correct decision.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:07.370
Milady Kihel has grown up...

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:09.120
Dianna Soriel!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.700
It doesn't matter.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.040
This will make the Militia even more arrogant!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.820
Then we will protect ourselves with pride and self-respect.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.130
Is this a joke!?

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.500
What situation did Dianna's speech just put us all into?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.620
Now they'll think we're all clowns!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:30.220
We took down a SUMO Class...

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:33.630
...and now that broadcast just made it even more possible for us to win!

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:37.310
Our mechanical dolls are now in the best shape!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.230
You can't control armies with idealistic speeches...

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.900
Kihel Heim!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.990
Not even a commoner like Guin Rhineford's Kihel Heim...

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:50.330
...would be naive enough to have such thoughts, Queen Dianna.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.200
That is all I have to say.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:57.540
Don't you dare compare a commoner from earth with the Queen of the Moonrace.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:01.560
My people will be satisfied with what I have said!

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.920
If a mechanical doll like that doesn't have a great leader to direct it...

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:07.680
then it's worthless, is it not, Lady Lily?

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:13.140
You're right. One should only attempt to declare a fiefdom if they have the strength to stand behind it.

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:15.720
That's correct.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:42.350
<i>This large hover ship is placed under my command.</i>

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:44.360
<i>l want to use it to search for Ms. Teteth...</i>

00:23:44.910 --> 00:23:47.720
<i>However, we end up being discovered by three WaDoms...</i>

00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:51.160
<i>...and Lady Sochie launches in order to battle them by herself.</i>

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:55.870
<i>Because the White Doll's head is being repaired, I was having a difficult time helping her...</i>

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:57.140
<i>...But I still pull it off somehow.</i>

00:23:58.300 --> 00:24:01.080
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN-A GUNDAM...

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.820
<i>Sochie's War</i>

00:24:03.130 --> 00:24:05.160
"Will one's determination be able to beat the wind?"

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Sochie's War</b>
